{%- comment -%}
  AJ Ships From — supplier attribution on the product page.

  Two jobs, both specific to selling other people's brands.

  TRUST. Nobody arrives at this store knowing who "prodigalpottery" or
  "Blessed Bayou Candles" are. Naming the maker turns an anonymous listing into
  someone's product, which matters far more here than it would for a
  single-brand store.

  EXPECTATION. Every Collective supplier fulfils its own items, so a cart
  mixing vendors arrives as separate parcels on separate days. Said before
  purchase that is a normal fact about buying from independent makers; found
  out afterwards it is a support ticket, and the most common one for
  multi-vendor dropship.

  DELIVERY ESTIMATES ARE NOT AVAILABLE. Collective attaches no metafields to
  imported products — no ship time, no dispatch window, nothing the theme can
  read. Anything specific here would have to be typed in by hand per vendor and
  kept accurate, and a stale delivery promise is worse than none. So the copy
  deliberately sets a shape ("ships separately") without inventing a date.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign product_resource = closest.product
  assign vendor = product_resource.vendor

  comment
    The tag is what Collective itself applies on import, so it is the honest
    test for "is this fulfilled by someone else" rather than guessing from the
    vendor name.
  endcomment
  assign is_collective = false
  if product_resource.tags contains 'Shopify Collective'
    assign is_collective = true
  endif
-%}

{%- if vendor != blank -%}
  <div
    class="aj-ships-from spacing-style"
    style="{% render 'spacing-style', settings: block.settings %}"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    <p class="aj-ships-from__line">
      {{ block.settings.prefix | default: 'Ships from' }}
      <strong>{{ vendor | escape }}</strong>
    </p>

    {%- if is_collective and block.settings.show_separate_note -%}
      <p class="aj-ships-from__note">{{ block.settings.separate_note | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .aj-ships-from__line {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--font-paragraph--size);
  }

  .aj-ships-from__note {
    margin: 0.15rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
    max-width: 46ch;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "AJ Ships From",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Names the maker fulfilling this product. Hidden when a product has no vendor set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "prefix",
      "label": "Prefix",
      "default": "Ships from"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_separate_note",
      "label": "Note that items ship separately",
      "default": true,
      "info": "Shown only on Shopify Collective products. Each supplier ships its own items, so a mixed order arrives in more than one parcel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "separate_note",
      "label": "Separate shipment note",
      "default": "Made to order by an independent maker. Items from different makers ship separately.",
      "info": "Avoid naming a delivery date here — Collective does not give the theme real ship times, so any date would be guesswork."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "Top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "Bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "AJ Ships From",
      "category": "Product"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
